 your team your company or a country  so when we roll into these countries and  we think that the best way for them to  be is the western way  it's not the right answer you can't  impose it on people what you have to do  is you have to allow people to discover  the truth for themselves  that's what you have to do you have to  allow them to see the benefits  of the way things are going  that's what you have to do and it takes  longer  takes it appears to take longer  it appears to take longer  but in the end it is  infinitely more efficient  and that is a  attitude that we haven't quite figured  out yet  many leaders haven't figured out on a  personal level in their family many  leaders haven't figured out in a company  and we as a nation certainly haven't  seemed to figure out yet  that  in trying to impose our will forcefully  is less efficient  than allowing countries to develop  and find the truth for themselves  and learn for themselves the benefits of  freedom learn for themselves  the benefits of free thought  and if we allow them to do that that  will be a lasting cultural change  not imposed by us  but grown from their own minds  and therefore  therefore  inherently becoming a part of the way  that they live  and that is something we need to keep in  mind  and we need to keep in mind and i know  this audience is going to have any  problem with that  that  any criticism we might have for uh some  of the leadership decisions that are  taken the marine whose text message we  read is correct that you know the  sailors soldiers airmen marines who are  out there you guys are a light in the  darkness  and um nobody can ever take that away  from you  that is the absolute truth  all right  i think that's it for now  um thanks for tuning in everybody  we appreciate it thanks for subscribing  we're sorry we haven't gotten much of  this done  we've been  busy  which sounds like a big excuse to me but  um we're working  in the meantime  some of the things we are busy wit